@startuml pr-fix-findings-before
!include ../../theme.iuml
title pr-fix-findings — today (ts_agent_helper CLI)

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Developer" as Dev

box "Developer workstation" $ws_bg
    participant "Claude\n(pr-fix-findings skill)" as Agent
    participant "ts-agent-helper\n(ts_agent_helper CLI)" as Helper
end box

box "Teamscale server" $ts_bg
    participant "Teamscale\nREST API" as TS
end box

Dev -> Agent : /teamscale:pr-fix-findings
Agent -[$cli_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**ts-agent-helper findings for-pr**</size>
activate Helper
Helper -> Helper : git branch --show-current
Helper -> TS : GET /api/projects/{p}/merge-requests\n?filter=<branch>&status=OPEN
activate TS
TS --> Helper : open merge requests
deactivate TS
Helper -> Helper : re-filter for exact sourceBranch → MR id,\nelse base-branch fallback\n(git symbolic-ref origin/HEAD)
Helper -> TS : GET /api/projects/{p}/merge-requests/finding-churn\n(merge-request id, or branch:HEAD vs base)
activate TS
TS --> Helper : findings newly added on the branch
deactivate TS
Helper --> Agent : resolution banner (stderr)\n+ findings JSON (stdout)
deactivate Helper

Agent -> Agent : triage, read code, edit files to fix

opt false positive / toleration (after explicit user OK)
    Agent -[$cli_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**ts-agent-helper findings flag …**</size>
    Helper -> TS : PUT /api/v2026.2/projects/{p}/findings/flagged
    TS --> Helper : ok
    Helper --> Agent : ok
end

Agent --> Dev : summary — fixed / tolerated / skipped

note over Helper
  The CLI bundles the whole PR resolution: run git,
  match the open MR, fall back to base branch, then fetch.
end note

@enduml
